Compact factual references for the first 100 available LibriVox catalogue links:
book titles, author names, genre labels, approximate durations and source ranks.
Entries without a catalogue link are skipped. The source automatically matches
Project Gutenberg download popularity to LibriVox recordings; this is not a
ranking of narrator quality. Attribution to the source is retained.

No website source code, article prose, download counts, Guardian list tags,
recordings or cover artwork are included. Source metadata is not relabelled as
our original MIT application code. Linked works and recordings retain their own
terms. See docs/AUDIOBOOKS.md and THIRD_PARTY.md for runtime source notices.
